{"server":"cn","storyId":"act9mini_level_act9mini_st04","groupId":"act9mini","stageId":null,"title":"只影孤身","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9mini/level_act9mini_st04.txt","sourceHash":"fce08763ba3b9a28b70beb845b1447eab17b2ae4f89ab5986dff4214487fb9b8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"将塑料骑士从无胄盟的袭击下救出，面对态度不逊的瑟奇亚克，感染者骑士“远牙”查丝汀娜回想起自己曾经的遭遇和回不去的故乡。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔1.5-7"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"查丝汀娜，你又爬到草垛上去了。\n你总往那边看，又是在看大骑士领吗？\n我知道，我当然知道大骑士领，那是很厉害的骑士老爷们会一起参加比赛的地方，对吧？\n你都说过多少回了，我当然早就记住了！\n......\n哎，查丝汀娜，你真的要上那儿去吗？\n我知道你不干农活的时候都在练习。嗯，村子里没人不知道你一直想当骑士，你能打跑来闹事的强盗，那些坏家伙都不是你的对手。\n但是查丝汀娜，大骑士领有多远啊......你去了，还会回来吗？\n你会回来？真的？当上骑士就回来？\n......那就这么说定了。我们都等着你荣归故里，到时我们就到处去宣传，这里可是骑士查丝汀娜的故乡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟杀手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"没有脚印，没有人通过的痕迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟杀手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"他们没有从这方向走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟领队","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"医院的小队弄丢了目标，这些人想逃脱必然要经过这周边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟领队","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"保持警惕，随时汇报情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟杀手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟杀手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟杀手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟杀手","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"呃、 啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们很快就会发现这里的异常，趁现在，快跟我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"还轮不到你来指挥我，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"能从那个距离如此轻松地解决掉这群下贱的东西，我是得承认你有些实力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"但是别搞错了，这不代表我就要听从你的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一带，都被无胄盟的人包围，你一个人很难逃出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会一直追着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"我会叫他们为自己的愚蠢后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的伤还没好，现在想要躲过他们的耳目会很难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......该死的无胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应和你们合作，但是记住，这只是因为我们有同一个对手。我要让那些下贱的凶手为他们的行为付出代价！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些之后再谈，我们现在还没完全脱困。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"我不觉得我和你们还有什么更多好谈的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，感谢那个提出荒唐要求的冠军吧，若非如此，你不会有穿上这身甲胄在这里和我说话的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经，非常感谢血骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，这就说不出话来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......比赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看过你和玛莉娅·临光的对决——“塑料”瑟奇亚克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜欢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在赛场上，比现在要稍微不那么讨厌一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"你的心情无关紧要，但注意你的态度。既然是这样，你就不该将我从医院带出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜觉得有必要这么做。况且——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"况且什么。索娜，这就是你们头领的名字？哼，听起来又是个小姑娘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......索娜是伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在回据点，索娜和其他伙伴都在等我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"......别因为我暂时同意联手，就把我和你们混为一谈，感染者骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我不会弄混，你和我们都不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，“塑料”瑟奇亚克，你自己应该也清楚，你没办法独自对抗无胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......没错，你说得不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"真是可笑，现在的这个卡西米尔，就连感染者都能被称作骑士，无胄盟一群在阴沟中作祟的小人竟也能满地横行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"可笑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先和其他人汇合吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"势单力薄，我们什么都做不成。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"narration","text":"十天前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不是平民，你们到底是什么人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没完没了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的路人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"混在人群里是想要偷袭吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别太小看我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！先别动手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊呀，我是不是来得晚了一点，怎么已经变成大混战了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不好办了，这下可不好办了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"别磨蹭了，事已至此，只能先把人带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"也只能这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好，“远牙”骑士，我还没恭喜你成功拿到骑士封号呢，这可是大好事呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到关于你的报道了，人气高涨，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"宣布要建立独立骑士团，争议连连，人气高涨？哼，结果就是惹来这群蝇虫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的路人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者骑士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"少啰嗦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的路人？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，反正打都打了，已经被他们抓到把柄了，唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"焰尾，还有灰毫......你们为什么会出现在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们知道这群人的来历？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"一清二楚。不过这里不适合站着聊天......这些家伙想把事情闹大，一会儿肯定就有报社的人要来了，这对你没好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，你应该是受伤了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"如果信得过我们，就先跟我们一起走，之后我们慢慢说明情况，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜，这套话你说出来像是在诱拐别人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？有吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要去哪，带我一起去吧。我信你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们和我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都是一样的。我信你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！你出来得好快，伤口已经处理好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的这些人，他们都是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"没错哦。住在这的大家都是感染者，大部分都是因为各种事故不走运地染病，丢了工作丢了家，无处可去的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然这里吃住都还简陋了点啦......但有总比没有好，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜，艾沃娜那边出了点问题，我先过去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟应该还会有所行动，最近我会让其他人也都小心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我清楚。放心，有我看着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰毫骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。交给你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊，你说小灰啊，她是个不错的家伙，就是说话有的时候太一板一眼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从见面到现在，她没有和我说过话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......可能是小灰她有点认生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（叹气）哎，好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"其实是小灰她总觉得你和我们不太一样，可能和我们不会是一路的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你可是这次特锦赛的明星选手，刚拿到了骑士封号，炙手可热！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么看都前途一片大好嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......感染者骑士，不会有什么大好前途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不像是刚赢了比赛的人说出来的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来以为既然还有机会能够成为骑士，就还有希望。如果能赢比赛，或许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"或许还能赢得尊敬，真的被看作是个骑士，赢回过去的生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我这么想过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，这是不可能的。感染者骑士依然是感染者，没什么不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。我就是这么和小灰说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"况且——就算是骑士又怎么样呢？看看混在人群里袭击你的那些人，他们可不管你是感染者骑士，还是贵族骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些人，就是你说的无胄盟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士杀手......令人讨厌的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，就是他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"为商业联合会卖命，暗地里解决掉那些不听话的骑士......他们自称是对付骑士的专家，对此还颇感自豪呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，在观众们的欢呼和打赏面前，就算是正经骑士，又留着多少尊严？更何况是我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次袭击我，也是商业联合会的指示？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"应该是了。你的表现太耀眼，又不肯加入找上门来的那些骑士团，还说出那种宣言......这些人迟早会找上门来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然不肯变成他们的摇钱树，那就只好让你“不名誉”地退场，免得妨碍商机了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，因为这种原因被袭击，是不是觉得很荒唐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......两个三周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在来大骑士领的路上，我不小心感染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为是感染者，所以被拒绝注册成为骑士，又因为没有旅店可以住，而在边缘地块徘徊了三周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三周的时候，血骑士赢了那一届的特锦赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又过了三周，面向感染者的骑士注册窗口正式建立并且对外开放了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个时候，我身上已经不剩下什么钱，所以我去了黑市的擂台，才终于凑够了注册需要的手续费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那还真是......不容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者骑士的地下竞技场，和黑市也差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从地下竞技场到特锦赛，我见过太多荒唐的事，已经不会因此而吃惊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你说得没错......地下竞技场里比无胄盟还离谱的事情可太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因为大家或多或少都经历过这些，所以现在我们才会像这样聚集在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里还有很多普通感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......该怎么说呢，骑士竞赛还是能赚到不少的，至少足够买下这些无处可去的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这么一来，这些钱也还算有点价值，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你的性格比我们之前想的要好相处不少......最开始和你搭上话的时候，还真以为你人很冷酷呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，怎么又不说话了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种时候应该说什么，我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......至少我现在明白了，你和小灰都挺认生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你这个先说半截的说话习惯，我也差不多习惯了。嗯，除了偶尔有点难理解以外，也没什么不好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不管怎么说，谢谢你们这次帮我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里哪里，不用这么客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，接下来你准备去哪？要是立刻复出，很可能再次被那些人盯上哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"没准很快今天的事件就要上报了，猜猜看，他们会把新闻写成什么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。随他们吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不知道该去哪。我早就没地方可去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，或许有点挟恩图报的嫌疑......不过这可不是一时心血来潮，我发誓我早就想这么做了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我和小灰，还有艾沃娜，你也见过的，就是那个嗓门很大的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我记得她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......关于你之前对外宣布的要建独立骑士团这事儿，我们也有相同的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"名字是我起的，我们叫它红松，红松骑士团，我们自己的骑士团。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有其他地方可以去的话，查丝汀娜，要不要考虑一下，加入我们，和我们一起走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是在......邀请我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确定吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焰尾骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，难道我说得还不够直接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红松骑士团......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。我加入你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我们......一起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"查丝汀娜，你就要出发了吗？\n再吹一次你的口笛吧，吹什么都行，你吹的大家都爱听。\n......\n真好听。\n今后很难再听到你吹的旋律了，大伙一定都会很想念你。\n你一个人走得那么远，怎么能让人不担心呢？你明明那么怕寂寞，却又总不好意思说，只会默不作声地坐在大家旁边。\n你说，风会把你的声音带回来吗？\n你会成为骑士的。我们都相信你一定能成为很了不起的骑士，就像、就像你喜欢的那个耀骑士一样。\n祝你好运，查丝汀娜。\n记得常回来看看我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G07"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到这里应该就没问题了，前面会有人接应，我们安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的伤还好吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么问题，这点小伤不值一提。倒是你们感染者骑士，你们的据点居然在城市内部，而不是边缘或是村庄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"没人会容许感染者生活在这座城市里——你们耍了什么花招？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有花招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有钱，没有那么难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，钱......说的不错，只要有钱，在这个地方什么都不难办到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"但凡走露风声，你们就全都会因为违法而被捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在有人说出什么不该说的之前，我的箭会解决他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不允许任何人危害到红松骑士团。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"那就快替我指路吧，只要想到那些无胄盟的渣滓还在外逍遥，我就一刻也无法忍受。既然决定要和商业联合会作对，就动作越快越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"让我去见见你们那个能让有你这样实力的感染者骑士违背自身意愿，将我带出医院的感染者骑士领袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不算违背。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"——什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救出塑料骑士这个任务，不是索娜要求，是我自己主动要去的。这并不违背我的个人意愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么回事，我以为我们双方都不对彼此有任何好感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，你要告诉我这是一种顾全大局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......你有家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思......难道说？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"这群蝼蚁，他们竟敢对那孩子动手？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，索娜让人一直盯着。无胄盟的杀手已经撤退了，他们没有对你的儿子怎么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑料骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"我会为此道谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对索娜说吧。全都是她在安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于我，我不希望看到你出事和我是否欣赏你个人无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，看到你的儿子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有你，那个男孩就无家可归了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士查丝汀娜有家乡，有期盼她的亲人，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不属于感染者查丝汀娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染者无处可去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不仅是感染者，在这里，很多人都没有归处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果风真的能把我的声音带回去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就请闭口不言，除了口笛的旋律，什么也别说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让查丝汀娜仍然是个简单的，平凡的......做着骑士美梦的女孩吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
